+# Viche telemetry observability gaps — reliability/measurement research
+
+**Date:** 2026-11-23
+**Author:** Executive Innovation Office (temporary research agent, worktree `office/telemetry-coverage-research-20261122`)
+**Class:** research inquiry — not a bill, not an implementation, not a compliance verdict, not a case closure.
+**Scope:** research-only, read-only on law, ballots, government code and canonical records. Nothing written to production state. Outputs: this file (worktree) and measurement scratch (`/tmp/opencode/state/`).
+
+Predecessor context: `records/research/2026-11-18-suite-compliance-snapshot-retention.md` (Front Retention F/S, Nov 18). This report is a distinct objective: (1) current coverage of Viche's own observation instruments; (2) drivers of coverage gaps; (3) honest cost-benefit of candidate improvements.
